<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 1.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.57 vs   1.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.43 vs   1.33</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.64 vs   1.29</p>
<p> Sales		   25.82 vs  27.92</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    14.54 vs  15.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	15.01 vs  15.25</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.46 vs  11.34</p>
<p> Sales		  193.37 vs 190.08</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Budimex</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
